# Blog

BLOG (`/blog`, `/blog/$slug`) is separate from CUSTOM_PAGES (`$slug` CMS).

- Do not implement or render blog posts through `$slug` / pages-cms.
- Homepage “Community Blog” must keep using the real Blog system (`/blog`), not CMS pages.
- Blog tasks must not edit `$slug` CMS routing unless a proven shared regression.
- Guard: `npm run test:guard:blog`. `/blog` stays 200.
